<text x="2" y="68" size="1.8" layer="21" ratio="12">xPort Wallplug rev A — 110 x 70 mm, 2 layers, 1.6 mm FR-4</text>
<text x="2" y="65.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">MAINS: L → F1 → PS1.1 ; N → PS1.2 ; MOV1 across L-N after F1</text>
<text x="52" y="68" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">HAZARDOUS VOLTAGE — 6.4 mm creepage to all SELV copper</text>
<text x="52" y="65.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">Barrier line: no copper crosses it except inside PS1</text>
<text x="30" y="1.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">DE-9: pin row 1 is 7.70 mm from this board edge</text>
<text x="76" y="55" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">≥1 in² copper on the shield tabs = heatsink (IG §2)</text></plain>
